# GlobeMind V0.9.3 Web/API/CC runtime, CPython 3.11 on Linux x86_64.
#
# Audited roots:
#   backend/serve_prod.py -> api.application -> api.routes/api.services
#   cppt.cc_bridge and assistant image subprocess entry
#   fuzzy search through numpy + pymilvus, remote BGE HTTP when available,
#   and the current local BGE fallback
#   ppt-master document, image, SVG and PPTX helper entry points
#
# Deliberately excluded role boundaries:
#   GLiNER and vLLM
# vLLM remains an HTTP dependency. GLiNER belongs to a pipeline runtime. The
# local BGE fallback remains necessary until a dedicated service is deployed.

